  <p id="c-sanguozhi-062-appraisal:line052" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　評曰：<persName id="c-sanguozhi-062-appraisal:line052:m0005" ref="q6j_1qg_qm2">是儀</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-062-appraisal:line052:m0008" ref="28m_ezf_3e7">徐詳</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-062-appraisal:line052:m0011" ref="qfk_09j_fhe">胡綜</persName>，皆<persName id="c-sanguozhi-062-appraisal:line052:m0015" ref="572_278_cba">孫權</persName>之時干興事業者也。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-062-appraisal:line052:m0026" ref="q6j_1qg_qm2">儀</persName>清恪貞素，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-062-appraisal:line052:m0032" ref="28m_ezf_3e7">詳</persName>數通使命，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-062-appraisal:line052:m0038" ref="qfk_09j_fhe">綜</persName>文采才用，各見信任，譬之廣夏，其榱椽之佐乎!</p>
</text>
